  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened, inclusive and resilient education systems in Eastern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO will support countries in the region to improve and inform inclusive education policies and practices and to build on regional commitments (Djibouti Declaration) for inclusion of refugees into national education systems to make the right of education a reality even. This workplan also aims at enhancing the capacities of Member States in education sector policies, planning, management, and monitoring to strengthen resilience and equitable education systems to respond to evolving learning environments and to better deliver on SDG4 commitments. The work will be conducted through technical support for (i) system strengthening and reforms, and (ii) better data, evidence, and guidance.</narrative>
  </description>
